<title>JAPAN: Kansai Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kansai Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.30 trln	 vs	    1.29 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  160.02		vs	  161.41</p>
<p> Current	     54.08		vs	   63.26</p>
<p> Net		   30.54		vs	   21.72</p>
<p> EPS		   31.21 yen	  vs	   22.42 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     979 million	 vs	  969 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 25.00 yen	  vs	   25.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kansai Electric Power Co Inc is an electric power company.</p>
